SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Systems thinking
DESCRIPTION:Sociocracy For All\nDescription Kelly Leonard and Stefani Dane
 s of Rachel Carson EcoVillage share their community’s practice of “Tra
 nsformative Communication” — blending sociocracy and Non-Violent Commu
